{
  "title": "博望荣誉｜博望团队马俊龙律师受邀参与《便利店特许经营管理规范》辽宁省地方标准评审并被聘为连锁行业法务专家",
  "author": "博望餐饮法务团队",
  "publish_time": "2025年3月3日 13:05",
  "content_html": "<section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"text-align: center; visibility: visible;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif\" data-galleryid=\"\" data-imgfileid=\"100000013\" data-ratio=\"0.24559777571825764\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/jNSvMVkX72L826RPff6TOIiabMvBmE36mfsrY4oZfPcLGhUVtGkiaHxh2MALUmmbmhUFwDhakaDGtKVvNyKMMoLg/640?wx_fmt=gif#imgIndex=0\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"1079\" style=\"height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important; width: 676.969px !important;\" data-original-style=\"\" data-index=\"3\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/jNSvMVkX72L826RPff6TOIiabMvBmE36mfsrY4oZfPcLGhUVtGkiaHxh2MALUmmbmhUFwDhakaDGtKVvNyKMMoLg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=0\" _width=\"677px\" data-order=\"0\" alt=\"图片\" data-report-img-idx=\"0\" data-fail=\"0\"></p><section style=\"text-align: center; justify-content: center; display: flex; flex-flow: row; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block; width: 90%; vertical-align: top; align-self: flex-start; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding: 20px; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(202, 132, 40); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify; font-size: 14px; line-height: 2; letter-spacing: 1px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">2025年2月27日，辽宁省连锁经营协会召开了由辽宁省市场监督管理局拟发布的<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">《便利店特许经营管理规范》</strong>辽宁省地方标准审查会，辽宁省商务厅、辽宁省市场监督管理局相关负责人参与并主持本次会议。北京盈科（沈阳）律师事务所监事会监事、专业化发展与人才战略委员会主任、股权高级合伙人、博望餐饮法务咨询团队首席法务<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">马俊龙律师</strong>作为辽宁省连锁经营协会特聘标准审查专家，受邀参与了此次审查会并为《便利店特许经营管理规范》辽宁省地方标准的制定贡献了专业力量。</p></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center; justify-content: center; display: flex; flex-flow: row; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block; width: 100%; vertical-align: top; align-self: flex-start; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-style: solid; border-width: 0px; border-color: rgb(202, 132, 40); padding: 20px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px; line-height: 0; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%; vertical-align: middle; display: inline-block; line-height: 0; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.75\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/jNSvMVkX72JMA17VPuu8ET72t8rH1T64wCo2aaGeXHgyNh4TOcro0ZvIxC7tgG801kAicAJz1GnwyChAGQIraCA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg#imgIndex=1\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; width: 637px !important; box-sizing: border-box; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"4\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/jNSvMVkX72JMA17VPuu8ET72t8rH1T64wCo2aaGeXHgyNh4TOcro0ZvIxC7tgG801kAicAJz1GnwyChAGQIraCA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=1\" _width=\"100%\" alt=\"图片\" data-report-img-idx=\"1\" data-fail=\"0\"></section></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p></section><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 0px 0px 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 100%;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px;background-color: rgb(202, 132, 40);box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);padding: 0px 8px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"margin: -5px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 15px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1px;line-height: 1;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">标准制定</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 30px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 14px;line-height: 2;letter-spacing: 1px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">便利店商业特许经营作为一种重要的商业模式，在辽宁省的零售市场中占据着重要地位。为规范便利店特许经营活动，让特许人与被许可人之间具备信任、公平合理的交易环境，辽宁省市场监督管理局拟在全国率先制定并推出<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">《便利店特许经营管理规范》</strong>。此次会议旨在对标准草案进行深入审查和完善，确保其科学性、合理性和可操作性。</p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">在本次评审工作中，马俊龙律师凭借自身在连锁领域丰富的经验，积极参与讨论，对标准草案中的条款进行了深度分析。他从法律合规性、行业实践性等多维度对<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">《便利店特许经营管理规范》</strong>评审稿及<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">《辽宁省地方标准&lt;便利店特许经营管理规范&gt;编制说明》</strong>提出了宝贵的意见和建议。</p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: right;margin: 10px 0px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 77%;height: auto;border-top-right-radius: 42px;border-bottom-left-radius: 42px;border-bottom-right-radius: 42px;overflow: hidden;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_img_placeholder wx_img_placeholder\" data-ratio=\"0.8\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/jNSvMVkX72JMA17VPuu8ET72t8rH1T64EQvBTyhUs05Nl0EuFSgmob7ibZOCa6f9TLzH6zbvaLP2w9SWNOeRX0w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg#imgIndex=2\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; aspect-ratio: calc(1.25) / 1; width: 490px !important; height: auto !important;\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"5\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3C%3Fxml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'%3F%3E%3Csvg width='1px' height='1px' viewBox='0 0 1 1' version='1.1' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink'%3E%3Ctitle%3E%3C/title%3E%3Cg stroke='none' stroke-width='1' fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd' fill-opacity='0'%3E%3Cg transform='translate(-249.000000, -126.000000)' fill='%23FFFFFF'%3E%3Crect x='249' y='126' width='1' height='1'%3E%3C/rect%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E\" _width=\"100%\" alt=\"图片\"></section></section><section style=\"text-align: left;margin: 10px 0px 40px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 77%;height: auto;border-bottom-left-radius: 42px;border-bottom-right-radius: 42px;overflow: hidden;border-top-left-radius: 42px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_img_placeholder wx_img_placeholder\" data-ratio=\"0.7481481481481481\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/jNSvMVkX72JMA17VPuu8ET72t8rH1T64P3TicbZ0IrvXxtGlvqZRg6bdZ9shKjXnQw5I50PJp98xjmRiaBYt6PNg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg#imgIndex=3\" data-w=\"540\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; aspect-ratio: calc(1.33663) / 1; width: 490px !important; height: auto !important;\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"6\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3C%3Fxml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'%3F%3E%3Csvg width='1px' height='1px' viewBox='0 0 1 1' version='1.1' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink'%3E%3Ctitle%3E%3C/title%3E%3Cg stroke='none' stroke-width='1' fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd' fill-opacity='0'%3E%3Cg transform='translate(-249.000000, -126.000000)' fill='%23FFFFFF'%3E%3Crect x='249' y='126' width='1' height='1'%3E%3C/rect%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E\" _width=\"100%\" alt=\"图片\"></section></section><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 0px 0px 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 100%;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px;background-color: rgb(202, 132, 40);box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);padding: 0px 8px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"margin: -5px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 15px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1px;line-height: 1;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">专业引领</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 30px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 14px;line-height: 2;letter-spacing: 1px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">马俊龙律师执业以来一直为各类连锁企业提供常年法律顾问及专项顾问服务，曾由辽宁省商务厅推荐到商务部培训中心为全国连锁企业主讲商业特许经营（连锁加盟）相关股权、法务课程，并作为花椒餐博大会、花椒学社股权法务专家和连锁模型专家，深度服务近百家各领域连锁企业，典型客户包括：新隆嘉、开心农场、百家乐超市、凯特琳洗衣连锁、开普医疗、大象口腔、百时教育、精思教育、纳智教育、山河屯铁锅炖、宏姐串串香、1949豆腐脑、伟大航路烤鱼、辣嘴鸭、柏记水饺、碰碰凉、北丐烧烤、小董哥烤串、刘八两板面、熊喵来了火锅、黑马座小灶等诸多连锁品牌。</p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 0px 0px 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 100%;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px;background-color: rgb(202, 132, 40);box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);padding: 0px 8px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"margin: -5px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 15px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1px;line-height: 1;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">行业赋能</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 30px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 14px;line-height: 2;letter-spacing: 1px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">此次审查会的召开，标志着<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">《便利店特许经营管理规范》</strong>辽宁省地方标准的制定工作取得了重要进展。这一标准的实施，对辽宁省商业特许经营活动的管理和该领域服务质量整体提升具有重要意义。</p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">此次会议，马俊龙律师以其在连锁行业法律事务中卓越表现与专业能力，被辽宁省连锁经营协会特聘为<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">“连锁行业法务专家”</strong>。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_img_placeholder wx_img_placeholder\" data-ratio=\"0.75\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/jNSvMVkX72JMA17VPuu8ET72t8rH1T64xcMs432BZo7Yf3ibVzOicnNS6m8HUWfLph7722FHI65TCZ8MT7YRNw9Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg#imgIndex=4\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; aspect-ratio: calc(1.33333) / 1; width: 637px !important; height: auto !important;\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"7\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3C%3Fxml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'%3F%3E%3Csvg width='1px' height='1px' viewBox='0 0 1 1' version='1.1' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink'%3E%3Ctitle%3E%3C/title%3E%3Cg stroke='none' stroke-width='1' fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd' fill-opacity='0'%3E%3Cg transform='translate(-249.000000, -126.000000)' fill='%23FFFFFF'%3E%3Crect x='249' y='126' width='1' height='1'%3E%3C/rect%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E\" _width=\"100%\" alt=\"图片\"></section></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-galleryid=\"\" data-imgfileid=\"100000292\" data-ratio=\"2.0444444444444443\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/jNSvMVkX72IRu9cDPObrZkMGERkBFBftNPwUyswtS3YjOWL3oTLOx6iajkQL2NeGzDMAYVGjiarhJco9FPQC0ib7w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg#imgIndex=5\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important; width: 636.984px !im